  <participating-org role="4" type="90">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">StreetNet International is a global network made up of informal economy workers&apos; and street vendors&apos; organizations and unions on five continents. We are constituted and led by informal economy of the workers, and we advocate and programme in the interests of these workers. Our slogan, &quot;Nothing for us without us,&quot; reflects our belief in the critical importance of participation and direct engagement of street vendors (and other informal sector workers) to development and change to their own sector and to the societies and economies within which they work.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">StreetNet International</narrative>
